Package: central-audio
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, pulseaudio-utils, mawk | awk
Suggests: scrcpy (>= 2.3), ffmpeg, adb, chromium | firefox-esr, procps
Description: GTK2 audio controls with optional Android microphone capture
 Inspect PulseAudio-compatible sources and sinks, select defaults for new
 streams, adjust volume, and restore changes saved by the application.
 .
 Optional Android microphone capture uses separately installed scrcpy,
 FFmpeg with the PulseAudio output device, and adb. Web browsers remain
 separate system applications. No browser or Android capture executable
 is bundled, and the application does not install or replace an audio server.
